    "generalSituationZh": "受東北季候風及一道雲帶影響，未來一兩日廣東早晚清涼。隨著東北季候風緩和及雲帶轉薄，本週後期該區漸轉天晴，氣溫回升。預料一股乾燥的東北季候風會在週末期間影響華南沿岸，該區日夜溫差頗大。",
    "generalSituationEn": "Under the influence of the northeast monsoon and a band of clouds, it will be cool in the morning and at night over Guangdong in the next couple of days. With the northeast monsoon moderating and the band of clouds thinning out, the weather will become fine and temperatures will rise over the region in the latter part of this week. A dry northeast monsoon is expected to affect the coast of southern China over the weekend. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large over the region.",
